course: dictionary
lesson: 13102
title: Short forms: abbreviations
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: An abbreviation is a short way of writing a word or phrase. It saves space on labels, signs and maps, and it often ends with a full stop. The short form «fl» has several meanings, so the words and places around it tell you which one is right.
explain: On a drink label, «12 fl oz» means 12 fluid ounces, a measure of how much liquid there is. On a lift sign, «3rd fl.» means the third floor. In an address, «Miami, FL» uses capital letters, and FL is short for Florida, a state in the USA.
explain: Historians sometimes write «fl.» before a date, such as «fl. 1500». This is not about a floor or a state. It is short for floruit, a Latin word meaning «flourished», and it shows when a person was known to be active. Always check where you found the short form, then ask which meaning fits.
fact: An abbreviation is a shortened form of a word or group of words.
fact: «fl oz» means fluid ounce, a unit for measuring liquids, used in the USA and UK.
fact: «fl.» can mean floor in a building, as in «3rd fl.».
fact: «FL» is the short form for Florida, a state in the USA.
fact: «fl.» can also mean floruit, Latin for «flourished»; it is written before a time when a person is known to have been active.
exercise: The label says «12 fl oz». What does fl oz stand for? | Flowers in a garden | Florida, the state | *A fluid ounce, a measure of liquid | A floor in a building
exercise: The lift sign says «3rd fl». What does fl mean here? | *Floor | Florida | Fluid | Flourished
exercise: The address says «Miami, FL». What does FL stand for? | *Florida | Flat | Floor
test: A historian writes «fl. 1500» next to a painter's name. What does fl. most likely mean? | Fluid ounce | Floor of a building | Florida | *Floruit, showing when the painter was known to be active
test: Which item would show fluid ounces? | A map of Europe | *A juice bottle marked 16 fl oz | A bus stop sign | A bag of sand marked 2 kg
exam: The sign says «Lift to 4th fl.» and a letter is addressed to «Orlando, FL». What does fl mean on the sign? | Floruit | *Floor | Florida | Fluid ounce
